[style name="dialogue_style"]
The shriveled corpse of Count Dracula lays motionless on the bed.
if {body_seen} == false:
	set {body_seen} = true
	It is penetrated through the heart by a wooden stake.
	Ash-covered wooden stake added to journal.
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"add_evidence":"murder_weapon"}"]
if {key_known} == true:
	- Search body
		set {has_key} = true
		Dracula's cloak has many pockets on the inside.
		In a pocket on the bottom-right side, you find an ornate key.
		Golden key added to journal.
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"add_evidence":"key"}"]
	- Leave
